## COMMUNICATION
A convenient and versatile amino acid-boosted biomimetic strategy was presented for nondestructive encapsulation of biomacromolecules within Metal-Organic Framework. The tightness of structural confinement within porous MOFs allowed the biomacromolecules with excellent stability, and endowed the composite system with novel functionality for biostorage, biocatalysis and sensing.
